	Snapshot Vault & Restoration
Snapshots are stored in sanctuary/vault/ as compressed .tar.gz archives accompanied by .jham matrix manifests.
Terminal Commands
Action
	Command
	List Vault Snapshots
	python jham_snapshot_vault.py list
	Create Snapshot
	python jham_snapshot_vault.py create [label]
	Restore Snapshot via Vault
	python jham_snapshot_vault.py restore [timestamp]
	Native Terminal Unpack
	tar -xzvf sanctuary/vault/ecosystem_snap_<timestamp>.tar.gz
	Inspect Contents
	tar -tzvf sanctuary/vault/ecosystem_snap_<timestamp>.tar.gz